OL,3,GNEWSAFringe ticket record as calls grow
OL,4,Afor date change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record number of people attended
OL,7,Fshows on a single day at this year's
OL,8,FEdinburgh Festival Fringe, according to
OL,9,Forganisers.
OL,11,FThe Fringe Society ` which oversees the
OL,12,Funcurated festival ` said it notched up
OL,13,Fthe highest attendance for a single
OL,14,Fday, on the second Saturday in August.
OL,15,FMore than 164,000 tickets were issued,
OL,16,Fwhich was 1% higher than the previous
OL,17,Fpeak on Saturday 17 August 2019.
OL,19,FOverall, 2.8 million tickets for Fringe
OL,20,Fshows were issued during this year's
OL,21,Fevent - an 8% increase on last year.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
